84 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Hi fellow Sharks,</p><p>We can’t win them all. While PYPL may look like a value play on paper, the earnings call was not very encouraging. I think the stock will be range‑bound (if not drifting lower) in the medium term, so I’d rather close the position and relocate the capital.</p><p>Usually, I don’t like selling when everyone else is bailing (like today), since more often than not the shares rebound a bit. But when I don’t like the story anymore, I prefer to rip the band‑aid quickly and move on, even if it means leaving a couple of dollars on the table.</p><p>Full rationale and post‑mortem coming in the days ahead.</p><div><hr></div><h3>Trade alert:</h3><ul><li><p>Close PYPL </p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg\" width=\"754\" height=\"42\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/e6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:42,&quot;width&quot;:754,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:10841,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/186749887?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eAF8!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe6a5e182-a9c9-451c-9533-1fa14e136717_754x42.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><div><hr></div><p>PYPL was the first monthly pick of the newsletter, and we are closing with a 52% loss. But it was a small position of the portfolio, so the impact was immaterial.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png\" width=\"586\" height=\"78.48214285714286\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:120,&quot;width&quot;:896,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:586,&quot;bytes&quot;:22269,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/186749887?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!1MEf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3ca24767-8656-4f05-a4b5-356e33b3d8c1_896x120.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Here is the updated track record of the monthly picks (paid members can click <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/stock-picks-performance-paid\">here</a>). The good part is that the winners outpace the losers in both count and magnitude.</p><div id=\"datawrapper-iframe\" class=\"datawrapper-wrap outer\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/Lz6Br/55/&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/93ad2ad2-4e45-424c-9761-337e90b6478a_1220x1598.png&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url_full&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/3759bd69-c872-4fff-bce0-285162c27802_1220x1870.png&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:915,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Stock Pick Performance&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;These are the real-time scorecards for my stock picks. Returns are measured from the day I published them; open ones are unrealized. I only show annualized numbers after 30 days—short windows make those figures silly.&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"DatawrapperToDOM\"><iframe id=\"iframe-datawrapper\" class=\"datawrapper-iframe\" src=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/Lz6Br/55/\" width=\"730\" height=\"915\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe><script type=\"text/javascript\">!function(){\"use strict\";window.addEventListener(\"message\",(function(e){if(void 0!==e.data[\"datawrapper-height\"]){var t=document.querySelectorAll(\"iframe\");for(var a in e.data[\"datawrapper-height\"])for(var r=0;r<t.length;r++){if(t[r].contentWindow===e.source)t[r].style.height=e.data[\"datawrapper-height\"][a]+\"px\"}}}))}();</script></div>",
